[PcdsFeatureFlag]

[PcdsFixedAtBuild]

[PcdsDynamic]
  ### Number of DRAM scrubber to use
  ###   @li 0xFF - Auto
  ###   @li SSP Max is 4
  ###   @li Others are 1
  gEfiAmdAgesaModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricNumOfScrubber|0xFF|UINT8|0x00DF0001

  ### Number of sequential scrubs to issue when DF exits Cstate
  ###   @li 0xFF - Auto
  ###   Valid range 0x0 to 0xF
  gEfiAmdAgesaModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricNumSeqScrubsCstateExit|0xFF|UINT8|0x00DF0002

  ### Enable DF Cstate switch
  ###   @li 0xFF - Auto
  gEfiAmdAgesaModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricCstate|0xFF|UINT8|0x00DF0003

  ### Enable DF sync flood.
  ###   For all families except SM/RV/TR (ZEN1)
  ###   @li TRUE  - Enable DF sync flood
  ###   @li FALSE - Disnable DF sync flood
  gEfiAmdAgesaModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricImmSyncFloodOnFatalErrCtrl|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x00DF0004

  ### Enable DF sync flood.
  ###  For all families except SM/RV/TR (ZEN1)
  ###  @li TRUE  - Enable DF sync flood
  ###  @li FALSE - Disnable DF sync flood
  gEfiAmdAgesaModulePkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdAmdFabricDisImmSyncFloodOnFatalErr|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x00DF0005

